 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I can't file a payroll access request for you. Payroll is a restricted system, and POL-ACC-02 limits it to full-time Finance and HR staff. Your record shows you are full-time in Operations, so you aren't eligible. The helpdesk can't make exceptions. Under POL-ACC-02, an exception needs your department head to email Security directly.\n\nFor the overtime hours, you'll need another route. I can escalate that question to HR if you'd like, or your manager (E005 Kofi Mensah) can advise on how to get your hours corrected.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-02"
 ]
}
